note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note One run of the host recompute of a flagged element (CUDApp#144, src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c host_dot): n stored
note elements of row i of op(A) (type ta) and column j of op(B) (type tb), gathered by the C shell inside one block_k
note block, added in k order: s += ((f64 a) * (f64 b)) * f, f = (f64 sa) * (f64 sb) under block scales; without them
note f is 1.0 and the product times f is the product itself (x * 1.0 = x exactly, a NaN x already quiet), so s += x.
note q: 0 ta, 1 tb, 2 n (<= 16384), 3 s bits in, 4 block scales, 5 sa bits, 6 sb bits. Gives the s bits out.
note a and b are read as words (the C shell gathers them into word-aligned windows).
fn gemm_ex_dot q view ulong 8 a view ulong 8192 b view ulong 8192 to ulong
ta = get q 0
tb = get q 1
ea = gx_es ta
eb = gx_es tb
s = bitcast f64 get q 3
if eq get q 4 0
for i ulong get q 2
x = f64 gx_ldf ta gx_wel view a i ea
s = add s mul x f64 gx_ldf tb gx_wel view b i eb
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
f = f64 bitcast f32 uint get q 5
f = mul f f64 bitcast f32 uint get q 6
for i ulong get q 2
x = f64 gx_ldf ta gx_wel view a i ea
x = mul x f64 gx_ldf tb gx_wel view b i eb
s = add s mul x f
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
